+# GOD Mode addition
+
+This modified source adds a new connected navigation section named **GOD**.
+
+## Mass Harvest
+
+- Reads the current live `Session.garden` snapshot.
+- Groups planted crops by species so one selection can target every planted crop of that type.
+- Shows how many crops of each species are mature and harvestable.
+- Immature crops remain visible but cannot be selected until their `endTime` has passed.
+- Provides **Select all ready** and **Clear** controls.
+- **COLLECT X SELECTED** sends `HarvestCrop` for every selected mature `(tileId, slotIndex)` pair.
+- The ViewModel re-validates every target against the latest garden state before sending.
+- Batch commands are sent sequentially with a 50 ms spacing and deduplicated targets.
+- Selection clears immediately after submission to prevent accidental duplicate batches while server patches are arriving.
+
+## Files changed
+
+- `app/src/main/java/com/mgafk/app/ui/screens/MainScreen.kt`
+- `app/src/main/java/com/mgafk/app/ui/MainViewModel.kt`
+- Added `app/src/main/java/com/mgafk/app/ui/screens/god/GodCard.kt`
